#: sssd.conf.5.xml:1732
msgid ""
"How many seconds will the PAM responder wait for passkey_child to finish."
msgstr "Cik sekundes PAM atbildētājs gaidīs, līdz passkey_child pabeigs darbu."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd.conf.5.xml:1741
msgid "pam_app_services (string)"
msgstr "pam_app_services (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd.conf.5.xml:1744
msgid ""
"Which PAM services are permitted to contact domains of type "
"<quote>application</quote>"
msgstr ""
"Kuriem PAM pakalpojumiem atļauts sazināties ar domēniem, kuru tips ir <quote>"
"application</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd.conf.5.xml:1753
msgid "pam_p11_allowed_services (string)"
msgstr "pam_p11_allowed_services (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd.conf.5.xml:1756
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of PAM service names for which it will be allowed to "
"use Smartcards."
msgstr ""
"Ar komatiem atdalīts PAM pakalpojumu nosaukumu saraksts, kuriem būs atļauts "
"izmantot viedkartes."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para><programlisting>
#: sssd.conf.5.xml:1771
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pam_p11_allowed_services = +my_pam_service, -login\n"
"                            "
msgstr ""
"pam_p11_allowed_services = +my_pam_service, -login\n"
"                            "

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd.conf.5.xml:1760
msgid ""
"It is possible to add another PAM service name to the default set by using "
"<quote>+service_name</quote> or to explicitly remove a PAM service name from "
"the default set by using <quote>-service_name</quote>. For example, in order "
"to replace a default PAM service name for authentication with Smartcards "
"(e.g. <quote>login</quote>) with a custom PAM service name (e.g. "
"<quote>my_pam_service</quote>), you would use the following configuration: "
"<placeholder type=\"programlisting\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Noklusējuma kopai var pievienot citu PAM pakalpojuma nosaukumu, izmantojot "
"<quote>+service_name</quote>, vai skaidri noņemt PAM pakalpojuma nosaukumu "
"no noklusējuma kopas, izmantojot <quote>-service_name</quote>. Piemēram, lai "
"noklusējuma PAM pakalpojuma nosaukumu autentifikācijai ar viedkartēm (piem., "
"<quote>login</quote>) aizstātu ar pielāgotu PAM pakalpojuma nosaukumu "
"(piem., <quote>my_pam_service</quote>), izmantotu šādu konfigurāciju: "
"<placeholder type=\"programlisting\" id=\"0\"/>"

