msgstr "decipherOnly"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:167
msgid ""
"A numerical value in the range of a 32bit unsigned integer can be used as "
