msgstr "Atbilst SAN registeredID vērtībai kā punktētai decimālai virknei."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:367
msgid "Example: &lt;SAN:registeredID&gt;1\\.2\\.3\\..*"
msgstr "Piemērs: &lt;SAN:registeredID&gt;1\\.2\\.3\\..*"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:96
msgid ""
"The available options are: <placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr "Pieejamās opcijas: <placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><title>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:375
msgid "MAPPING RULE"
msgstr "KARTĒŠANAS KĀRTULA"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:377
msgid ""
"The mapping rule is used to associate a certificate with one or more "
"accounts. A Smartcard with the certificate and the matching private key can "
"then be used to authenticate as one of those accounts."
msgstr ""
"Kartēšanas kārtulu izmanto, lai saistītu sertifikātu ar vienu vai vairākiem "
"kontiem. Viedkarti ar sertifikātu un atbilstošo privāto atslēgu tad var "
"izmantot, lai autentificētos kā viens no šiem kontiem."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:382
msgid ""
"Currently SSSD basically only supports LDAP to lookup user information (the "
"exception is the proxy provider which is not of relevance here). Because of "
"this the mapping rule is based on LDAP search filter syntax with templates "
"to add certificate content to the filter. It is expected that the filter "
"will only contain the specific data needed for the mapping and that the "
"caller will embed it in another filter to do the actual search. Because of "
"this the filter string should start and stop with '(' and ')' respectively."
msgstr ""
"Pašlaik SSSD lietotāju informācijas uzmeklēšanai būtībā atbalsta tikai LDAP "
"(izņēmums ir starpniekservera nodrošinātājs, kas šeit nav būtisks). Tāpēc "
"kartēšanas kārtula balstās uz LDAP meklēšanas filtra sintaksi ar veidnēm "
"sertifikāta satura pievienošanai filtram. Paredzēts, ka filtrs saturēs tikai "
"kartēšanai vajadzīgos konkrētos datus un izsaucējs to iegulīs citā filtrā, "
"lai veiktu faktisko meklēšanu. Tāpēc filtra virknei attiecīgi jāsākas ar „(” "
"un jābeidzas ar „)”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:392
msgid ""
"In general it is recommended to use attributes from the certificate and add "
"them to special attributes to the LDAP user object. E.g. the "
"'altSecurityIdentities' attribute in AD or the 'ipaCertMapData' attribute "
"for IPA can be used."
msgstr ""
"Kopumā ieteicams izmantot sertifikāta atribūtus un pievienot tos LDAP "
"lietotāja objekta īpašiem atribūtiem. Piem., var izmantot AD atribūtu „"
"altSecurityIdentities” vai IPA atribūtu „ipaCertMapData”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:398
msgid ""
"This should be preferred to read user specific data from the certificate "
"like e.g. an email address and search for it in the LDAP server. The reason "
"is that the user specific data in LDAP might change for various reasons "
"would break the mapping. On the other hand it would be hard to break the "
"mapping on purpose for a specific user."
msgstr ""
"Tam jādod priekšroka pār lietotājam specifisku datu, piem., e-pasta adreses, "
"nolasīšanu no sertifikāta un meklēšanu LDAP serverī. Iemesls ir tas, ka "
"lietotājam specifiskie dati LDAP dažādu iemeslu dēļ var mainīties un sabojāt "
"kartēšanu. Savukārt tīši sabojāt kartēšanu konkrētam lietotājam būtu grūti."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:406
msgid ""
"The default <quote>mapping rule</quote> type is 'LDAP' which can be added as "
"a prefix to a rule like e.g.  'LDAP:(userCertificate;binary={cert!bin})'. "
"There is an extension called 'LDAPU1' which offer more templates for more "
"flexibility. To allow older versions of this library to ignore the extension "
"the prefix 'LDAPU1' must be used when using the new templates in a "
"<quote>mapping rule</quote> otherwise the old version of this library will "
"fail with a parsing error. The new templates are described in section <xref "
"linkend=\"map_ldapu1\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Noklusējuma <quote>kartēšanas kārtulas</quote> tips ir „LDAP”, ko var "
"pievienot kārtulai kā priedēkli, piem.,  „LDAP:(userCertificate;binary="
"{cert!bin})”. Ir paplašinājums „LDAPU1”, kas piedāvā vairāk veidņu lielākai "
"elastībai. Lai vecākas šīs bibliotēkas versijas varētu ignorēt "
"paplašinājumu, izmantojot jaunās veidnes <quote>kartēšanas kārtulā</quote>, "
"jāizmanto priedēklis „LDAPU1”, citādi vecā šīs bibliotēkas versija "
"neizdosies ar parsēšanas kļūdu. Jaunās veidnes aprakstītas sadaļā <xref "
"linkend=\"map_ldapu1\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:424
msgid "{issuer_dn[!((ad|ad_x500)|ad_ldap|nss_x500|(nss|nss_ldap))]}"
msgstr "{issuer_dn[!((ad|ad_x500)|ad_ldap|nss_x500|(nss|nss_ldap))]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:427
msgid ""
"This template will add the full issuer DN converted to a string according to "
"RFC 4514. If X.500 ordering (most specific RDN comes last) an option with "
"the '_x500' prefix should be used."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos pilnu izdevēja DN, kas pārveidots par virkni saskaņā ar "
"RFC 4514. Ja X.500 secība (specifiskākais RDN ir pēdējais), jāizmanto opcija "
"ar priedēkli „_x500”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:433 sss-certmap.5.xml:459
msgid ""
"The conversion options starting with 'ad_' will use attribute names as used "
"by AD, e.g. 'S' instead of 'ST'."
msgstr ""
"Pārveidošanas opcijas, kas sākas ar „ad_”, izmantos atribūtu nosaukumus kā "
"AD, piem., „S”, nevis „ST”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:437 sss-certmap.5.xml:463
msgid ""
"The conversion options starting with 'nss_' will use attribute names as used "
"by NSS."
msgstr ""
"Pārveidošanas opcijas, kas sākas ar „nss_”, izmantos atribūtu nosaukumus kā "
"NSS."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:441 sss-certmap.5.xml:467
msgid ""
"The default conversion option is 'nss', i.e. attribute names according to "
"NSS and LDAP/RFC 4514 ordering."
msgstr ""
"Noklusējuma pārveidošanas opcija ir „nss”, t. i., atribūtu nosaukumi "
"atbilstoši NSS un LDAP/RFC 4514 secībai."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:445
msgid ""
"Example: (ipacertmapdata=X509:&lt;I&gt;{issuer_dn!ad}&lt;S&gt;{subject_dn!"
"ad})"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: (ipacertmapdata=X509:&lt;I&gt;{issuer_dn!ad}&lt;S&gt;"
"{subject_dn!ad})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:450
msgid "{subject_dn[!((ad|ad_x500)|ad_ldap|nss_x500|(nss|nss_ldap))]}"
msgstr "{subject_dn[!((ad|ad_x500)|ad_ldap|nss_x500|(nss|nss_ldap))]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:453
msgid ""
"This template will add the full subject DN converted to string according to "
"RFC 4514. If X.500 ordering (most specific RDN comes last) an option with "
"the '_x500' prefix should be used."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos pilnu subjekta DN, kas pārveidots par virkni saskaņā ar "
"RFC 4514. Ja X.500 secība (specifiskākais RDN ir pēdējais), jāizmanto opcija "
"ar priedēkli „_x500”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:471
msgid ""
"Example: (ipacertmapdata=X509:&lt;I&gt;{issuer_dn!nss_x500}&lt;S&gt;"
"{subject_dn!nss_x500})"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: (ipacertmapdata=X509:&lt;I&gt;{issuer_dn!nss_x500}&lt;S&gt;"
"{subject_dn!nss_x500})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:476
msgid "{cert[!(bin|base64)]}"
msgstr "{cert[!(bin|base64)]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:479
msgid ""
"This template will add the whole DER encoded certificate as a string to the "
"search filter. Depending on the conversion option the binary certificate is "
"either converted to an escaped hex sequence '\\xx' or base64.  The escaped "
"hex sequence is the default and can e.g. be used with the LDAP attribute "
"'userCertificate;binary'."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos meklēšanas filtram visu DER kodēto sertifikātu kā "
"virkni. Atkarībā no pārveidošanas opcijas binārais sertifikāts tiek "
"pārveidots vai nu par heksadecimālu atsoļa secību „\\xx”, vai par base64.  "
"Heksadecimālā atsoļa secība ir noklusējums, un to var, piem., izmantot ar "
"LDAP atribūtu „userCertificate;binary”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:487
msgid "Example: (userCertificate;binary={cert!bin})"
msgstr "Piemērs: (userCertificate;binary={cert!bin})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:492
msgid "{subject_principal[.short_name]}"
msgstr "{subject_principal[.short_name]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:495
msgid ""
"This template will add the Kerberos principal which is taken either from the "
"SAN used by pkinit or the one used by AD. The 'short_name' component "
"represents the first part of the principal before the '@' sign."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos Kerberos principālu, kas ņemts vai nu no pkinit "
"izmantotā SAN, vai no AD izmantotā. Komponente „short_name” apzīmē "
"principāla pirmo daļu pirms zīmes „@”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:501
msgid ""
"Example: (|(userPrincipal={subject_principal})"
"(samAccountName={subject_principal.short_name}))"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: (|(userPrincipal={subject_principal})(samAccountName="
"{subject_principal.short_name}))"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:506
msgid "{subject_pkinit_principal[.short_name]}"
msgstr "{subject_pkinit_principal[.short_name]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:509
msgid ""
"This template will add the Kerberos principal which is given by the SAN used "
"by pkinit. The 'short_name' component represents the first part of the "
"principal before the '@' sign."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos Kerberos principālu, ko norāda pkinit izmantotais SAN. "
"Komponente „short_name” apzīmē principāla pirmo daļu pirms zīmes „@”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:515
msgid ""
"Example: (|(userPrincipal={subject_pkinit_principal})"
"(uid={subject_pkinit_principal.short_name}))"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: (|(userPrincipal={subject_pkinit_principal})(uid="
"{subject_pkinit_principal.short_name}))"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:520
msgid "{subject_nt_principal[.short_name]}"
msgstr "{subject_nt_principal[.short_name]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:523
msgid ""
"This template will add the Kerberos principal which is given by the SAN used "
"by AD. The 'short_name' component represent the first part of the principal "
"before the '@' sign."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos Kerberos principālu, ko norāda AD izmantotais SAN. "
"Komponente „short_name” apzīmē principāla pirmo daļu pirms zīmes „@”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:529
msgid ""
"Example: (|(userPrincipalName={subject_nt_principal})"
"(samAccountName={subject_nt_principal.short_name}))"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: (|(userPrincipalName={subject_nt_principal})(samAccountName="
"{subject_nt_principal.short_name}))"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:534
msgid "{subject_rfc822_name[.short_name]}"
msgstr "{subject_rfc822_name[.short_name]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:537
msgid ""
"This template will add the string which is stored in the rfc822Name "
"component of the SAN, typically an email address. The 'short_name' component "
"represents the first part of the address before the '@' sign."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos virkni, kas glabājas SAN komponentē rfc822Name, parasti "
"e-pasta adresi. Komponente „short_name” apzīmē adreses pirmo daļu pirms "
"zīmes „@”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:543
msgid ""
"Example: (|(mail={subject_rfc822_name})"
"(uid={subject_rfc822_name.short_name}))"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: (|(mail={subject_rfc822_name})(uid="
"{subject_rfc822_name.short_name}))"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:548
msgid "{subject_dns_name[.short_name]}"
msgstr "{subject_dns_name[.short_name]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:551
msgid ""
"This template will add the string which is stored in the dNSName component "
"of the SAN, typically a fully-qualified host name.  The 'short_name' "
"component represents the first part of the name before the first '.' sign."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos virkni, kas glabājas SAN komponentē dNSName, parasti "
"pilnībā kvalificētu resursdatora nosaukumu.  Komponente „short_name” apzīmē "
"nosaukuma pirmo daļu pirms pirmās zīmes „.”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:557
msgid ""
"Example: (|(fqdn={subject_dns_name})(host={subject_dns_name.short_name}))"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: (|(fqdn={subject_dns_name})(host={subject_dns_name.short_name}))"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:562
msgid "{subject_uri}"
msgstr "{subject_uri}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:565
msgid ""
"This template will add the string which is stored in the "
"uniformResourceIdentifier component of the SAN."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos virkni, kas glabājas SAN komponentē "
"uniformResourceIdentifier."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:569
msgid "Example: (uri={subject_uri})"
msgstr "Piemērs: (uri={subject_uri})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:574
msgid "{subject_ip_address}"
msgstr "{subject_ip_address}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:577
msgid ""
"This template will add the string which is stored in the iPAddress component "
"of the SAN."
msgstr "Šī veidne pievienos virkni, kas glabājas SAN komponentē iPAddress."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:581
msgid "Example: (ip={subject_ip_address})"
msgstr "Piemērs: (ip={subject_ip_address})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:586
msgid "{subject_x400_address}"
msgstr "{subject_x400_address}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:589
msgid ""
"This template will add the value which is stored in the x400Address "
"component of the SAN as escaped hex sequence."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos vērtību, kas glabājas SAN komponentē x400Address, kā "
"heksadecimālu atsoļa secību."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:594
msgid "Example: (attr:binary={subject_x400_address})"
msgstr "Piemērs: (attr:binary={subject_x400_address})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:599
msgid ""
"{subject_directory_name[!((ad|ad_x500)|ad_ldap|nss_x500|(nss|nss_ldap))]}"
msgstr ""
"{subject_directory_name[!((ad|ad_x500)|ad_ldap|nss_x500|(nss|nss_ldap))]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:602
msgid ""
"This template will add the DN string of the value which is stored in the "
"directoryName component of the SAN."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos DN virkni no vērtības, kas glabājas SAN komponentē "
"directoryName."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:606
msgid "Example: (orig_dn={subject_directory_name})"
msgstr "Piemērs: (orig_dn={subject_directory_name})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:611
msgid "{subject_ediparty_name}"
msgstr "{subject_ediparty_name}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:614
msgid ""
"This template will add the value which is stored in the ediPartyName "
"component of the SAN as escaped hex sequence."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos vērtību, kas glabājas SAN komponentē ediPartyName, kā "
"heksadecimālu atsoļa secību."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:619
msgid "Example: (attr:binary={subject_ediparty_name})"
msgstr "Piemērs: (attr:binary={subject_ediparty_name})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:624
msgid "{subject_registered_id}"
msgstr "{subject_registered_id}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:627
msgid ""
"This template will add the OID which is stored in the registeredID component "
"of the SAN as a dotted-decimal string."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos OID, kas glabājas SAN komponentē registeredID, kā "
"punktētu decimālu virkni."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:632
msgid "Example: (oid={subject_registered_id})"
msgstr "Piemērs: (oid={subject_registered_id})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:417
msgid ""
"The templates to add certificate data to the search filter are based on "
"Python-style formatting strings. They consist of a keyword in curly braces "
"with an optional sub-component specifier separated by a '.' or an optional "
"conversion/formatting option separated by a '!'.  Allowed values are: "
"<placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Veidnes sertifikāta datu pievienošanai meklēšanas filtram balstās uz Python "
"stila formatēšanas virknēm. Tās sastāv no atslēgvārda figūriekavās ar "
"neobligātu apakškomponentes norādītāju, atdalītu ar „.”, vai neobligātu "
"pārveidošanas/formatēšanas opciju, atdalītu ar „!”.  Atļautās vērtības: "
"<placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><title>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:639
msgid "LDAPU1 extension"
msgstr "Paplašinājums LDAPU1"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:641
msgid ""
"The following templates are available when using the 'LDAPU1' extension:"
msgstr "Izmantojot paplašinājumu „LDAPU1”, ir pieejamas šādas veidnes:"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:647
msgid "{serial_number[!(dec|hex[_ucr])]}"
msgstr "{serial_number[!(dec|hex[_ucr])]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:650
msgid ""
"This template will add the serial number of the certificate. By default it "
"will be printed as a hexadecimal number with lower-case letters."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos sertifikāta sērijas numuru. Pēc noklusējuma tas tiks "
"izvadīts kā heksadecimāls skaitlis ar mazajiem burtiem."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:655
msgid ""
"With the formatting option '!dec' the number will be printed as decimal "
"string. The hexadecimal output can be printed with upper-case letters ('!"
"hex_u'), with a colon separating the hexadecimal bytes ('!hex_c') or with "
"the hexadecimal bytes in reverse order ('!hex_r').  The postfix letters can "
"be combined so that e.g.  '!hex_uc' will produce a colon-separated "
"hexadecimal string with upper-case letters."
msgstr ""
"Ar formatēšanas opciju „!dec” numurs tiks izvadīts kā decimāla virkne. "
"Heksadecimālo izvadi var izvadīt ar lielajiem burtiem („!hex_u”), ar koliem "
"atdalot heksadecimālos baitus („!hex_c”) vai ar heksadecimālajiem baitiem "
"apgrieztā secībā („!hex_r”).  Piedēkļu burtus var kombinēt, piem., „!hex_uc” "
"radīs ar koliem atdalītu heksadecimālu virkni ar lielajiem burtiem."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:665
msgid "Example: LDAPU1:(serial={serial_number})"
msgstr "Piemērs: LDAPU1:(serial={serial_number})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:671
msgid "{subject_key_id[!hex[_ucr]]}"
msgstr "{subject_key_id[!hex[_ucr]]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:674
msgid ""
"This template will add the subject key id of the certificate. By default it "
"will be printed as a hexadecimal number with lower-case letters."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos sertifikāta subjekta atslēgas id. Pēc noklusējuma tas "
"tiks izvadīts kā heksadecimāls skaitlis ar mazajiem burtiem."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:679
msgid ""
"The hexadecimal output can be printed with upper-case letters ('!hex_u'), "
"with a colon separating the hexadecimal bytes ('!hex_c') or with the "
"hexadecimal bytes in reverse order ('!hex_r').  The postfix letters can be "
"combined so that e.g.  '!hex_uc' will produce a colon-separated hexadecimal "
"string with upper-case letters."
msgstr ""
"Heksadecimālo izvadi var izvadīt ar lielajiem burtiem („!hex_u”), ar koliem "
"atdalot heksadecimālos baitus („!hex_c”) vai ar heksadecimālajiem baitiem "
"apgrieztā secībā („!hex_r”).  Piedēkļu burtus var kombinēt, piem., „!hex_uc” "
"radīs ar koliem atdalītu heksadecimālu virkni ar lielajiem burtiem."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:688
msgid "Example: LDAPU1:(ski={subject_key_id})"
msgstr "Piemērs: LDAPU1:(ski={subject_key_id})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:694
msgid "{cert[!DIGEST[_ucr]]}"
msgstr "{cert[!DIGEST[_ucr]]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:697
msgid ""
"This template will add the hexadecimal digest/hash of the certificate where "
"DIGEST must be replaced with the name of a digest/hash function supported by "
"OpenSSL, e.g. 'sha512'."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos sertifikāta heksadecimālo īssavilkumu/jaucējvērtību, kur "
"DIGEST jāaizstāj ar OpenSSL atbalstītas īssavilkuma/jaucējfunkcijas "
"nosaukumu, piem., „sha512”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:703
msgid ""
"The hexadecimal output can be printed with upper-case letters ('!sha512_u'), "
"with a colon separating the hexadecimal bytes ('!sha512_c') or with the "
"hexadecimal bytes in reverse order ('!sha512_r'). The postfix letters can be "
"combined so that e.g. '!sha512_uc' will produce a colon-separated "
"hexadecimal string with upper-case letters."
msgstr ""
"Heksadecimālo izvadi var izvadīt ar lielajiem burtiem („!sha512_u”), ar "
"koliem atdalot heksadecimālos baitus („!sha512_c”) vai ar heksadecimālajiem "
"baitiem apgrieztā secībā („!sha512_r”). Piedēkļu burtus var kombinēt, piem., "
"„!sha512_uc” radīs ar koliem atdalītu heksadecimālu virkni ar lielajiem "
"burtiem."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:712
msgid "Example: LDAPU1:(dgst={cert!sha256})"
msgstr "Piemērs: LDAPU1:(dgst={cert!sha256})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:718
msgid "{subject_dn_component[(.attr_name|[number]]}"
msgstr "{subject_dn_component[(.attr_name|[number]]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:721
msgid ""
"This template will add an attribute value of a component of the subject DN, "
"by default the value of the most specific component."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos subjekta DN komponentes atribūta vērtību, pēc "
"noklusējuma specifiskākās komponentes vērtību."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:726
msgid ""
"A different component can be selected by either attribute name, e.g. "
"{subject_dn_component.uid} or by position, e.g. {subject_dn_component.[2]} "
"where positive numbers start counting from the most specific component and "
"negative numbers start counting from the least specific component. Attribute "
"name and the position can be combined as e.g.  {subject_dn_component.uid[2]} "
"which means that the name of the second component must be 'uid'."
msgstr ""
"Citu komponenti var atlasīt vai nu pēc atribūta nosaukuma, piem., "
"{subject_dn_component.uid}, vai pēc pozīcijas, piem., "
"{subject_dn_component.[2]}, kur pozitīvi skaitļi skaita no specifiskākās "
"komponentes, bet negatīvi — no vismazāk specifiskās. Atribūta nosaukumu un "
"pozīciju var kombinēt, piem.,  {subject_dn_component.uid[2]}, kas nozīmē, ka "
"otrās komponentes nosaukumam jābūt „uid”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:737
msgid "Example: LDAPU1:(uid={subject_dn_component.uid})"
msgstr "Piemērs: LDAPU1:(uid={subject_dn_component.uid})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:743
msgid "{issuer_dn_component[(.attr_name|[number]]}"
msgstr "{issuer_dn_component[(.attr_name|[number]]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:746
msgid ""
"This template will add an attribute value of a component of the issuer DN, "
"by default the value of the most specific component."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos izdevēja DN komponentes atribūta vērtību, pēc "
"noklusējuma specifiskākās komponentes vērtību."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:751
msgid ""
"See 'subject_dn_component' for details about the attribute name and position "
"specifiers."
msgstr ""
"Sīkāku informāciju par atribūta nosaukuma un pozīcijas norādītājiem skatiet „"
"subject_dn_component”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:755
msgid ""
"Example: LDAPU1:(domain={issuer_dn_component.[-2]}."
"{issuer_dn_component.dc[-1]})"
msgstr ""
"Piemērs: LDAPU1:(domain={issuer_dn_component.[-2]}.{issuer_dn_component.dc[-"
"1]})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:760
msgid "{sid[.rid]}"
msgstr "{sid[.rid]}"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:763
msgid ""
"This template will add the SID if the corresponding extension introduced by "
"Microsoft with the OID 1.3.6.1.4.1.311.25.2 is available. With the '.rid' "
"selector only the last component, i.e. the RID, will be added."
msgstr ""
"Šī veidne pievienos SID, ja ir pieejams attiecīgais Microsoft ieviestais "
"paplašinājums ar OID 1.3.6.1.4.1.311.25.2. Ar atlasītāju „.rid” tiks "
"pievienota tikai pēdējā komponente, t. i., RID."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><refsect3><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:770
msgid "Example: LDAPU1:(objectsid={sid})"
msgstr "Piemērs: LDAPU1:(objectsid={sid})"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><title>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:779
msgid "DOMAIN LIST"
msgstr "DOMĒNU SARAKSTS"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><refsect2><para>
#: sss-certmap.5.xml:781
msgid ""
"If the domain list is not empty users mapped to a given certificate are not "
"only searched in the local domain but in the listed domains as well as long "
"as they are know by SSSD. Domains not know to SSSD will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Ja domēnu saraksts nav tukšs, uz norādīto sertifikātu kartētie lietotāji "
"tiek meklēti ne tikai lokālajā domēnā, bet arī uzskaitītajos domēnos, ja "
"vien SSSD tos zina. SSSD nezināmi domēni tiks ignorēti."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refnamediv><refname>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:10 sssd-ipa.5.xml:16
msgid "sssd-ipa"
msgstr "sssd-ipa"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refnamediv><refpurpose>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:17
msgid "SSSD IPA provider"
msgstr "SSSD IPA nodrošinātājs"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:23
msgid ""
"This manual page describes the configuration of the IPA provider for "
"<citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>8</manvolnum> "
"</citerefentry>.  For a detailed syntax reference, refer to the <quote>FILE "
"FORMAT</quote> section of the <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd.conf</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry> manual page."
msgstr ""
"Šī rokasgrāmatas lapa apraksta IPA nodrošinātāja konfigurāciju rīkam "
"<citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>8</manvolnum> "
"</citerefentry>.  Detalizētu sintakses aprakstu skatiet rokasgrāmatas lapas "
"<citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd.conf</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</"
"manvolnum> </citerefentry> sadaļā <quote>FAILA FORMĀTS</quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:36
msgid ""
"The IPA provider is a back end used to connect to an IPA server.  (Refer to "
"the freeipa.org web site for information about IPA servers.)  This provider "
"requires that the machine be joined to the IPA domain; configuration is "
"almost entirely self-discovered and obtained directly from the server."
msgstr ""
"IPA nodrošinātājs ir aizmugursistēma savienojumam ar IPA serveri.  "
"(Informāciju par IPA serveriem skatiet tīmekļa vietnē freeipa.org.)  Šim "
"nodrošinātājam nepieciešams, lai dators būtu pievienots IPA domēnam; "
"konfigurācija gandrīz pilnībā tiek atklāta automātiski un iegūta tieši no "
"servera."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:43
msgid ""
"The IPA provider enables SSSD to use the <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd-"
"ldap</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry> identity "
"provider and the <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd-krb5</refentrytitle> "
"<manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry> authentication provider with "
"optimizations for IPA environments. The IPA provider accepts the same "
"options used by the sssd-ldap and sssd-krb5 providers with some exceptions. "
"However, it is neither necessary nor recommended to set these options."
msgstr ""
"IPA nodrošinātājs ļauj SSSD izmantot identitātes nodrošinātāju "
"<citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd-ldap</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</"
"manvolnum> </citerefentry> un autentifikācijas nodrošinātāju <citerefentry> "
"<refentrytitle>sssd-krb5</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </"
"citerefentry> ar optimizācijām IPA vidēm. IPA nodrošinātājs pieņem tās pašas "
"opcijas, ko sssd-ldap un sssd-krb5 nodrošinātāji, ar dažiem izņēmumiem. "
"Tomēr šīs opcijas iestatīt nav nepieciešams un nav ieteicams."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:57
msgid ""
"The IPA provider primarily copies the traditional ldap and krb5 provider "
"default options with some exceptions, the differences are listed in the "
"<quote>MODIFIED DEFAULT OPTIONS</quote> section."
msgstr ""
"IPA nodrošinātājs galvenokārt pārņem tradicionālo ldap un krb5 nodrošinātāju "
"noklusējuma opcijas ar dažiem izņēmumiem; atšķirības uzskaitītas sadaļā "
"<quote>MAINĪTĀS NOKLUSĒJUMA OPCIJAS</quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:62
msgid ""
"As an access provider, the IPA provider has a minimal configuration (see "
"<quote>ipa_access_order</quote>) as it mainly uses HBAC (host-based access "
"control) rules. Please refer to freeipa.org for more information about HBAC."
msgstr ""
"Kā piekļuves nodrošinātājam IPA nodrošinātājam ir minimāla konfigurācija "
"(skatiet <quote>ipa_access_order</quote>), jo tas galvenokārt izmanto HBAC "
"(uz resursdatoru balstītas piekļuves vadības) kārtulas. Plašāku informāciju "
"par HBAC skatiet freeipa.org."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:68
msgid ""
"If <quote>auth_provider=ipa</quote> or <quote>access_provider=ipa</quote> is "
"configured in sssd.conf then the id_provider must also be set to <quote>ipa</"
"quote>."
msgstr ""
"Ja sssd.conf ir konfigurēts <quote>auth_provider=ipa</quote> vai <quote>"
"access_provider=ipa</quote>, arī id_provider jābūt iestatītam uz <quote>ipa</"
"quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:74
msgid ""
"The IPA provider will use the PAC responder if the Kerberos tickets of users "
"from trusted realms contain a PAC. To make configuration easier the PAC "
"responder is started automatically if the IPA ID provider is configured."
msgstr ""
"IPA nodrošinātājs izmantos PAC atbildētāju, ja uzticamo apgabalu lietotāju "
"Kerberos biļetes satur PAC. Lai vienkāršotu konfigurēšanu, PAC atbildētājs "
"tiek palaists automātiski, ja ir konfigurēts IPA ID nodrošinātājs."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:90
msgid "ipa_domain (string)"
msgstr "ipa_domain (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:93
msgid ""
"Specifies the name of the IPA domain.  This is optional. If not provided, "
"the configuration domain name is used."
msgstr ""
"Norāda IPA domēna nosaukumu.  Tas nav obligāts. Ja nav norādīts, tiek "
"izmantots konfigurācijas domēna nosaukums."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:101
msgid "ipa_server, ipa_backup_server (string)"
msgstr "ipa_server, ipa_backup_server (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:104
msgid ""
"The comma-separated list of IP addresses or hostnames of the IPA servers to "
"which SSSD should connect in the order of preference. For more information "
"on failover and server redundancy, see the <quote>FAILOVER</quote> section.  "
"This is optional if autodiscovery is enabled.  For more information on "
"service discovery, refer to the <quote>SERVICE DISCOVERY</quote> section."
msgstr ""
"Ar komatiem atdalīts to IPA serveru IP adrešu vai resursdatoru nosaukumu "
"saraksts, ar kuriem SSSD jāsavienojas, vēlamības secībā. Plašāku informāciju "
"par pārņemšanu un serveru dublēšanu skatiet sadaļā <quote>FAILOVER</quote>.  "
"Ja iespējota automātiskā atklāšana, tas nav obligāts.  Plašāku informāciju "
"par pakalpojumu atklāšanu skatiet sadaļā <quote>SERVICE DISCOVERY</quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:117
msgid "ipa_hostname (string)"
msgstr "ipa_hostname (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:120
msgid ""
"Optional. May be set on machines where the hostname(5) does not reflect the "
"fully qualified name used in the IPA domain to identify this host.  The "
"hostname must be fully qualified."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Var iestatīt datoros, kuros hostname(5) neatspoguļo pilnībā "
"kvalificēto nosaukumu, ko IPA domēnā izmanto šī resursdatora "
"identificēšanai.  Resursdatora nosaukumam jābūt pilnībā kvalificētam."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:129 sssd-ad.5.xml:1166
msgid "dyndns_update (boolean)"
msgstr "dyndns_update (Būla vērtība)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:132
msgid ""
"Optional. This option tells SSSD to automatically update the DNS server "
"built into FreeIPA with the IP address of this client. The update is secured "
"using GSS-TSIG. The IP address of the IPA LDAP connection is used for the "
"updates, if it is not otherwise specified by using the <quote>dyndns_iface</"
"quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Šī opcija liek SSSD automātiski atjaunināt FreeIPA iebūvēto DNS "
"serveri ar šī klienta IP adresi. Atjauninājums tiek aizsargāts ar GSS-TSIG. "
"Atjauninājumiem tiek izmantota IPA LDAP savienojuma IP adrese, ja vien tā "
"nav citādi norādīta ar opciju <quote>dyndns_iface</quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:147 sssd-ad.5.xml:1186
msgid "dyndns_ttl (integer)"
msgstr "dyndns_ttl (vesels skaitlis)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:150 sssd-ad.5.xml:1189
msgid ""
"The TTL to apply to the client DNS record when updating it.  If "
"dyndns_update is false this has no effect. This will override the TTL "
"serverside if set by an administrator."
msgstr ""
"TTL, kas jāpiemēro klienta DNS ierakstam, to atjauninot.  Ja dyndns_update "
"ir false, tam nav ietekmes. Tas aizstās servera puses TTL, ja to iestatījis "
"administrators."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:155
msgid "Default: 1200 (seconds)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: 1200 (sekundes)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:161 sssd-ad.5.xml:1200
msgid "dyndns_iface (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_iface (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:164 sssd-ad.5.xml:1203
msgid ""
"Optional. Applicable only when dyndns_update is true. Choose the interface "
"or a list of interfaces whose IP addresses should be used for dynamic DNS "
"updates. The name of interface can be a wildcard pattern prefixed with "
"<emphasis>!</emphasis> for interface excluding. First match stops the "
"evaluation. For example list <emphasis>!eth1, *</emphasis> instruct SSSD to "
"use all interfaces except <emphasis>eth1</emphasis>.  See <emphasis>man 7 "
"glob</emphasis> for details about patterns."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Piemērojams tikai tad, ja dyndns_update ir true. Izvēlieties "
"saskarni vai saskarņu sarakstu, kuru IP adreses jāizmanto dinamiskiem DNS "
"atjauninājumiem. Saskarnes nosaukums var būt aizstājējzīmju šablons ar "
"priedēkli <emphasis>!</emphasis> saskarnes izslēgšanai. Pirmā atbilstība "
"aptur izvērtēšanu. Piemēram, saraksts <emphasis>!eth1, *</emphasis> liek "
"SSSD izmantot visas saskarnes, izņemot <emphasis>eth1</emphasis>.  Sīkāk par "
"šabloniem skatiet <emphasis>man 7 glob</emphasis>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:177
msgid ""
"Default: Use the IP addresses of the interface which is used for IPA LDAP "
"connection"
msgstr ""
"Noklusējums: izmantot tās saskarnes IP adreses, kas tiek izmantota IPA LDAP "
"savienojumam"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:181 sssd-ad.5.xml:1220
msgid "Example: dyndns_iface = em[12], !vnet1, vnet*"
msgstr "Piemērs: dyndns_iface = em[12], !vnet1, vnet*"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:187 sssd-ad.5.xml:1226
msgid "dyndns_address (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_address (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:190 sssd-ad.5.xml:1229
msgid ""
"Optional. Applicable only when <emphasis>dyndns_update</emphasis> is true.  "
"A list of IP addresses or IP networks to be used for dynamic DNS updates. "
"Network addresses must be in CIDR format. An entry can be prefixed with "
"<emphasis>!</emphasis> to indicate exclusion.  The <emphasis>best match</"
"emphasis> is used to determine whether an address is included or excluded "
"(i.e., a longer prefix takes precedence)."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Piemērojams tikai tad, ja <emphasis>dyndns_update</emphasis> ir "
"true.  Dinamiskiem DNS atjauninājumiem izmantojamo IP adrešu vai IP tīklu "
"saraksts. Tīklu adresēm jābūt CIDR formātā. Ierakstam var pievienot "
"priedēkli <emphasis>!</emphasis>, lai norādītu izslēgšanu.  Lai noteiktu, "
"vai adrese ir iekļauta vai izslēgta, tiek izmantota <emphasis>labākā "
"atbilstība</emphasis> (t. i., garākam priedēklim ir prioritāte)."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:201 sssd-ad.5.xml:1240
msgid "Default: No filtering of IP addresses."
msgstr "Noklusējums: No filtering of IP addresses."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:204 sssd-ad.5.xml:1243
msgid "Example: dyndns_address = 10.0.0.0/16, !10.0.1.0/24"
msgstr "Piemērs: dyndns_address = 10.0.0.0/16, !10.0.1.0/24"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:210 sssd-ad.5.xml:1298
msgid "dyndns_auth (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_auth (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:213 sssd-ad.5.xml:1301
msgid ""
"Whether the nsupdate utility should use GSS-TSIG authentication for secure "
"updates with the DNS server, insecure updates can be sent by setting this "
"option to 'none'."
msgstr ""
"Vai utilītai nsupdate drošiem atjauninājumiem ar DNS serveri jāizmanto GSS-"
"TSIG autentifikācija; nedrošus atjauninājumus var sūtīt, iestatot šo opciju "
"uz „none”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:219 sssd-ad.5.xml:1307
msgid "Default: GSS-TSIG"
msgstr "Noklusējums: GSS-TSIG"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:225 sssd-ad.5.xml:1313
msgid "dyndns_auth_ptr (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_auth_ptr (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:228 sssd-ad.5.xml:1316
msgid ""
"Whether the nsupdate utility should use GSS-TSIG authentication for secure "
"PTR updates with the DNS server, insecure updates can be sent by setting "
"this option to 'none'."
msgstr ""
"Vai utilītai nsupdate drošiem PTR atjauninājumiem ar DNS serveri jāizmanto "
"GSS-TSIG autentifikācija; nedrošus atjauninājumus var sūtīt, iestatot šo "
"opciju uz „none”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:234 sssd-ad.5.xml:1322
msgid "Default: Same as dyndns_auth"
msgstr "Noklusējums: Same as dyndns_auth"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:240 sssd-ad.5.xml:1249
msgid "dyndns_refresh_interval (integer)"
msgstr "dyndns_refresh_interval (vesels skaitlis)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:243
msgid ""
"How often should the back end perform periodic DNS update in addition to the "
"automatic update performed when the back end goes online.  This option is "
"optional and applicable only when dyndns_update is true."
msgstr ""
"Cik bieži aizmugursistēmai jāveic periodisks DNS atjauninājums papildus "
"automātiskajam atjauninājumam, kas tiek veikts, aizmugursistēmai pārejot "
"tiešsaistē.  Šī opcija nav obligāta un ir piemērojama tikai tad, ja "
"dyndns_update ir true."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:256 sssd-ad.5.xml:1266
msgid "dyndns_update_ptr (boolean)"
msgstr "dyndns_update_ptr (Būla vērtība)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:259 sssd-ad.5.xml:1269
msgid ""
"Whether the PTR record should also be explicitly updated when updating the "
"client's DNS records.  Applicable only when dyndns_update is true."
msgstr ""
"Vai, atjauninot klienta DNS ierakstus, skaidri jāatjaunina arī PTR "
"ieraksts.  Piemērojams tikai tad, ja dyndns_update ir true."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:264
msgid ""
"This option should be False in most IPA deployments as the IPA server "
"generates the PTR records automatically when forward records are changed."
msgstr ""
"Vairumā IPA izvietojumu šai opcijai jābūt False, jo IPA serveris automātiski "
"ģenerē PTR ierakstus, kad tiek mainīti tiešie ieraksti."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:270 sssd-ad.5.xml:1274
msgid ""
"Note that <emphasis>dyndns_update_per_family</emphasis> parameter does not "
"apply for PTR record updates.  Those updates are always sent separately."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka parametrs <emphasis>dyndns_update_per_family</emphasis> "
"neattiecas uz PTR ierakstu atjauninājumiem.  Šie atjauninājumi vienmēr tiek "
"sūtīti atsevišķi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:275
msgid "Default: False (disabled)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: False (atspējots)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:281 sssd-ad.5.xml:1285
msgid "dyndns_force_tcp (boolean)"
msgstr "dyndns_force_tcp (Būla vērtība)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:284 sssd-ad.5.xml:1288
msgid ""
"Whether the nsupdate utility should default to using TCP for communicating "
"with the DNS server."
msgstr ""
"Vai utilītai nsupdate saziņai ar DNS serveri pēc noklusējuma jāizmanto TCP."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:288 sssd-ad.5.xml:1292
msgid "Default: False (let nsupdate choose the protocol)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: False (ļaut nsupdate izvēlēties protokolu)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:294 sssd-ad.5.xml:1328
msgid "dyndns_server (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_server (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:297 sssd-ad.5.xml:1331
msgid ""
"The DNS server to use when performing a DNS update. In most setups, it's "
"recommended to leave this option unset."
msgstr ""
"DNS serveris, ko izmantot, veicot DNS atjauninājumu. Vairumā iestatījumu šo "
"opciju ieteicams atstāt neiestatītu."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:302 sssd-ad.5.xml:1336
msgid ""
"Setting this option makes sense for environments where the DNS server is "
"different from the identity server or when we use encrypted DNS."
msgstr ""
"Šīs opcijas iestatīšanai ir jēga vidēs, kurās DNS serveris atšķiras no "
"identitātes servera, vai tad, ja izmantojam šifrētu DNS."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:307 sssd-ad.5.xml:1341
msgid ""
"The parameter can be a simple string containing DNS name or IP address. It "
"can also be an URI.  The URI can look like <emphasis>dns://servername/</"
"emphasis> or <emphasis>dns+tls://1.2.3.4:853#servername/</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Parametrs var būt vienkārša virkne ar DNS nosaukumu vai IP adresi. Tas var "
"būt arī URI.  URI var izskatīties kā <emphasis>dns://servername/</emphasis> "
"vai <emphasis>dns+tls://1.2.3.4:853#servername/</emphasis>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:314 sssd-ad.5.xml:1348
msgid ""
"The second example enables DNS-over-TLS protocol for DNS updates. The "
"nsupdate utility must support DoT - check the <emphasis>man nsupdate</"
"emphasis> before enabling it in SSSD."
msgstr ""
"Otrais piemērs DNS atjauninājumiem iespējo protokolu DNS-over-TLS. Utilītai "
"nsupdate jāatbalsta DoT — pirms tā iespējošanas SSSD pārbaudiet <emphasis>"
"man nsupdate</emphasis>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:320 sssd-ad.5.xml:1354
msgid ""
"Please note that this option will be only used in fallback attempt when "
"previous attempt using autodetected settings failed or when DNS-over-TLS is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Lūdzu, ņemiet vērā, ka šī opcija tiks izmantota tikai rezerves mēģinājumā, "
"kad iepriekšējais mēģinājums ar automātiski noteiktiem iestatījumiem "
"neizdevās, vai tad, ja ir iespējots DNS-over-TLS."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:326 sssd-ad.5.xml:1360
msgid "Default: None (let nsupdate choose the server)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: None (ļaut nsupdate izvēlēties serveri)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:332 sssd-ad.5.xml:1366
msgid "dyndns_update_per_family (boolean)"
msgstr "dyndns_update_per_family (Būla vērtība)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:335 sssd-ad.5.xml:1369
msgid ""
"DNS update is by default performed in two steps - IPv4 update and then IPv6 "
"update. In some cases it might be desirable to perform IPv4 and IPv6 update "
"in single step."
msgstr ""
"DNS atjaunināšana pēc noklusējuma tiek veikta divos soļos — IPv4 "
"atjauninājums un pēc tam IPv6 atjauninājums. Dažos gadījumos var būt vēlams "
"veikt IPv4 un IPv6 atjauninājumu vienā solī."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:347 sssd-ad.5.xml:1381
msgid "dyndns_dot_cacert (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_dot_cacert (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:350 sssd-ad.5.xml:1384
msgid ""
"This option specifies the file of the certificate authorities certificates "
"(in PEM format) in order to verify the remote server TLS certificate when "
"using DoT."
msgstr ""
"Šī opcija norāda sertificēšanas iestāžu sertifikātu failu (PEM formātā), "
"lai, izmantojot DoT, pārbaudītu attālā servera TLS sertifikātu."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:356 sssd-ad.5.xml:1390
msgid "Default: None (use global certificate store)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: None (izmantot globālo sertifikātu krātuvi)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:362 sssd-ad.5.xml:1396
msgid "dyndns_dot_cert (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_dot_cert (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:365 sssd-ad.5.xml:1399
msgid ""
"This option sets the certificate(s) file for authentication for the DoT "
"transport to the remote server. The certificate chain file is expected to be "
"in PEM format."
msgstr ""
"Šī opcija iestata sertifikāta(-u) failu autentifikācijai DoT transportā pret "
"attālo serveri. Paredzēts, ka sertifikātu ķēdes fails ir PEM formātā."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:371 sssd-ad.5.xml:1405
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>dyndns_dot_cert</emphasis> and <emphasis>dyndns_dot_key</"
"emphasis> options must be both set to achieve mutual TLS authentication."
msgstr ""
"Lai panāktu savstarpēju TLS autentifikāciju, jāiestata abas opcijas "
"<emphasis>dyndns_dot_cert</emphasis> un <emphasis>dyndns_dot_key</emphasis>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:376 sssd-ipa.5.xml:391 sssd-ad.5.xml:1410 sssd-ad.5.xml:1425
msgid "Default: None (Do not use TLS authentication)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: None (neizmantot TLS autentifikāciju)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:382 sssd-ad.5.xml:1416
msgid "dyndns_dot_key (string)"
msgstr "dyndns_dot_key (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:385 sssd-ad.5.xml:1419
msgid ""
"This option sets the key file for authenticated encryption for the DoT "
"transport to the remote server. The private key file is expected to be in "
"PEM format."
msgstr ""
"Šī opcija iestata atslēgas failu autentificētai šifrēšanai DoT transportā "
"pret attālo serveri. Paredzēts, ka privātās atslēgas fails ir PEM formātā."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:397
msgid "ipa_access_order (string)"
msgstr "ipa_access_order (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:404
msgid "<emphasis>expire</emphasis>: use IPA's account expiration policy."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>expire</emphasis>: izmantot IPA konta derīguma beigu politiku."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:443
msgid ""
"Please note that 'access_provider = ipa' must be set for this feature to "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Lūdzu, ņemiet vērā, ka, lai šis līdzeklis darbotos, jābūt iestatītam „"
"access_provider = ipa”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:450
msgid "ipa_deskprofile_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_deskprofile_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:453
msgid ""
"Optional. Use the given string as search base for Desktop Profile related "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Izmantot norādīto virkni kā ar darbvirsmas profiliem saistīto "
"objektu meklēšanas bāzi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:457 sssd-ipa.5.xml:479
msgid "Default: Use base DN"
msgstr "Noklusējums: Use base DN"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:463
msgid "ipa_subid_ranges_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_subid_ranges_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:466
msgid "Deprecated. Use ldap_subid_ranges_search_base instead."
msgstr "Novecojis. Tā vietā izmantojiet ldap_subid_ranges_search_base."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:472
msgid "ipa_hbac_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_hbac_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:475
msgid "Optional. Use the given string as search base for HBAC related objects."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Izmantot norādīto virkni kā ar HBAC saistīto objektu meklēšanas "
"bāzi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:485
msgid "ipa_host_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_host_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:488
msgid "Deprecated. Use ldap_host_search_base instead."
msgstr "Novecojis. Tā vietā izmantojiet ldap_host_search_base."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:494
msgid "ipa_selinux_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_selinux_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:497
msgid "Optional. Use the given string as search base for SELinux user maps."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Izmantot norādīto virkni kā SELinux lietotāju karšu meklēšanas "
"bāzi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:513
msgid "ipa_subdomains_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_subdomains_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:516
msgid "Optional. Use the given string as search base for trusted domains."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Izmantot norādīto virkni kā uzticamo domēnu meklēšanas bāzi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:525
msgid "Default: the value of <emphasis>cn=trusts,%basedn</emphasis>"
msgstr "Noklusējums: <emphasis>cn=trusts,%basedn</emphasis> vērtība"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:532
msgid "ipa_master_domain_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_master_domain_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:535
msgid "Optional. Use the given string as search base for master domain object."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Izmantot norādīto virkni kā galvenā domēna objekta meklēšanas "
"bāzi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:544
msgid "Default: the value of <emphasis>cn=ad,cn=etc,%basedn</emphasis>"
msgstr "Noklusējums: <emphasis>cn=ad,cn=etc,%basedn</emphasis> vērtība"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:551
msgid "ipa_views_search_base (string)"
msgstr "ipa_views_search_base (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:554
msgid "Optional. Use the given string as search base for views containers."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāts. Izmantot norādīto virkni kā skatu konteineru meklēšanas bāzi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:563
msgid "Default: the value of <emphasis>cn=views,cn=accounts,%basedn</emphasis>"
msgstr "Noklusējums: <emphasis>cn=views,cn=accounts,%basedn</emphasis> vērtība"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:573
msgid ""
"The name of the Kerberos realm. This is optional and defaults to the value "
"of <quote>ipa_domain</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Kerberos apgabala nosaukums. Tas nav obligāts, un tā noklusējums ir <quote>"
"ipa_domain</quote> vērtība."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:577
msgid ""
"The name of the Kerberos realm has a special meaning in IPA - it is "
"converted into the base DN to use for performing LDAP operations."
msgstr ""
"Kerberos apgabala nosaukumam IPA ir īpaša nozīme — tas tiek pārveidots par "
"bāzes DN, ko izmantot LDAP darbībām."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:585 sssd-ad.5.xml:1434
msgid "krb5_confd_path (string)"
msgstr "krb5_confd_path (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:588 sssd-ad.5.xml:1437
msgid ""
"Absolute path of a directory where SSSD should place Kerberos configuration "
"snippets."
msgstr ""
"Absolūtais ceļš uz direktoriju, kurā SSSD jāievieto Kerberos konfigurācijas "
"fragmenti."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:592 sssd-ad.5.xml:1441
msgid ""
"To disable the creation of the configuration snippets set the parameter to "
"'none'."
msgstr ""
"Lai atspējotu konfigurācijas fragmentu izveidi, iestatiet parametru uz „none"
"”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:596 sssd-ad.5.xml:1445
msgid ""
"Default: not set (krb5.include.d subdirectory of SSSD's pubconf directory)"
msgstr ""
"Noklusējums: nav iestatīts (SSSD pubconf direktorijas apakšdirektorija "
"krb5.include.d)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:603
msgid "ipa_deskprofile_refresh (integer)"
msgstr "ipa_deskprofile_refresh (vesels skaitlis)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:606
msgid ""
"The amount of time between lookups of the Desktop Profile rules against the "
"IPA server. This will reduce the latency and load on the IPA server if there "
"are many desktop profiles requests made in a short period."
msgstr ""
"Laiks starp darbvirsmas profilu kārtulu uzmeklēšanām IPA serverī. Tas "
"samazinās aizturi un IPA servera slodzi, ja īsā laikā tiek veikts daudz "
"darbvirsmas profilu pieprasījumu."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:613 sssd-ipa.5.xml:643 sssd-ipa.5.xml:659 sssd-ad.5.xml:600
msgid "Default: 5 (seconds)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: 5 (sekundes)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:619
msgid "ipa_deskprofile_request_interval (integer)"
msgstr "ipa_deskprofile_request_interval (vesels skaitlis)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:622
msgid ""
"The amount of time between lookups of the Desktop Profile rules against the "
"IPA server in case the last request did not return any rule."
msgstr ""
"Laiks starp darbvirsmas profilu kārtulu uzmeklēšanām IPA serverī gadījumā, "
"ja pēdējais pieprasījums neatgrieza nevienu kārtulu."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:627
msgid "Default: 60 (minutes)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: 60 (minūtes)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:633
msgid "ipa_hbac_refresh (integer)"
msgstr "ipa_hbac_refresh (vesels skaitlis)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:636
msgid ""
"The amount of time between lookups of the HBAC rules against the IPA server. "
"This will reduce the latency and load on the IPA server if there are many "
"access-control requests made in a short period."
msgstr ""
"Laiks starp HBAC kārtulu uzmeklēšanām IPA serverī. Tas samazinās aizturi un "
"IPA servera slodzi, ja īsā laikā tiek veikts daudz piekļuves vadības "
"pieprasījumu."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:649
msgid "ipa_selinux_refresh (integer)"
msgstr "ipa_selinux_refresh (vesels skaitlis)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:652
msgid ""
"The amount of time between lookups of the SELinux maps against the IPA "
"server. This will reduce the latency and load on the IPA server if there are "
"many user login requests made in a short period."
msgstr ""
"Laiks starp SELinux karšu uzmeklēšanām IPA serverī. Tas samazinās aizturi un "
"IPA servera slodzi, ja īsā laikā tiek veikts daudz lietotāju pieteikšanās "
"pieprasījumu."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:665
msgid "ipa_server_mode (boolean)"
msgstr "ipa_server_mode (Būla vērtība)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:668
msgid ""
"This option will be set by the IPA installer (ipa-server-install) "
"automatically and denotes if SSSD is running on an IPA server or not."
msgstr ""
"Šo opciju automātiski iestata IPA instalētājs (ipa-server-install), un tā "
"norāda, vai SSSD darbojas IPA serverī."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:673
msgid ""
"On an IPA server SSSD will lookup users and groups from trusted domains "
"directly while on a client it will ask an IPA server."
msgstr ""
"IPA serverī SSSD uzmeklēs uzticamo domēnu lietotājus un grupas tieši, bet "
"klientā tas vaicās IPA serverim."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:678
msgid ""
"NOTE: There are currently some assumptions that must be met when SSSD is "
"running on an IPA server."
msgstr ""
"PIEZĪME: Pašlaik ir daži pieņēmumi, kuriem jāizpildās, kad SSSD darbojas IPA "
"serverī."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:683
msgid ""
"The <quote>ipa_server</quote> option must be configured to point to the IPA "
"server itself. This is already the default set by the IPA installer, so no "
"manual change is required."
msgstr ""
"Opcijai <quote>ipa_server</quote> jābūt konfigurētai tā, lai tā norādītu uz "
"pašu IPA serveri. Tas jau ir IPA instalētāja iestatītais noklusējums, tāpēc "
"manuālas izmaiņas nav vajadzīgas."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:692
msgid ""
"The <quote>full_name_format</quote> option must not be tweaked to only print "
"short names for users from trusted domains."
msgstr ""
"Opciju <quote>full_name_format</quote> nedrīkst pielāgot tā, lai uzticamo "
"domēnu lietotājiem tiktu izvadīti tikai īsie nosaukumi."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-ipa.5.xml:707
msgid "ipa_automount_location (string)"
msgstr "ipa_automount_location (virkne)"

