#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refnamediv><refname>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:10 sssd-krb5.5.xml:16
msgid "sssd-krb5"
msgstr "sssd-krb5"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refnamediv><refpurpose>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:17
msgid "SSSD Kerberos provider"
msgstr "SSSD Kerberos nodrošinātājs"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:23
msgid ""
"This manual page describes the configuration of the Kerberos 5 "
"authentication backend for <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>8</manvolnum> </citerefentry>.  For a detailed "
"syntax reference, please refer to the <quote>FILE FORMAT</quote> section of "
"the <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd.conf</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</"
"manvolnum> </citerefentry> manual page."
msgstr ""
"Šī rokasgrāmatas lapa apraksta Kerberos 5 autentifikācijas aizmugursistēmas "
"konfigurāciju rīkam <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd</refentrytitle> "
"<manvolnum>8</manvolnum> </citerefentry>.  Detalizētu sintakses aprakstu "
"skatiet rokasgrāmatas lapas <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd.conf</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry> sadaļā <quote>FAILA "
"FORMĀTS</quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:36
msgid ""
"The Kerberos 5 authentication backend contains auth and chpass providers. It "
"must be paired with an identity provider in order to function properly (for "
"example, id_provider = ldap). Some information required by the Kerberos 5 "
"authentication backend must be provided by the identity provider, such as "
"the user's Kerberos Principal Name (UPN). The configuration of the identity "
"provider should have an entry to specify the UPN. Please refer to the man "
"page for the applicable identity provider for details on how to configure "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Kerberos 5 autentifikācijas aizmugursistēma satur auth un chpass "
"nodrošinātājus. Lai tā darbotos pareizi, tā jāsapāro ar identitātes "
"nodrošinātāju (piemēram, id_provider = ldap). Daļa Kerberos 5 "
"autentifikācijas aizmugursistēmai vajadzīgās informācijas jānodrošina "
"identitātes nodrošinātājam, piemēram, lietotāja Kerberos principāla "
"nosaukums (UPN). Identitātes nodrošinātāja konfigurācijā jābūt ierakstam, "
"kas norāda UPN. Sīkāk par tā konfigurēšanu skatiet attiecīgā identitātes "
"nodrošinātāja rokasgrāmatas lapā."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:47
msgid ""
"This backend also provides access control based on the .k5login file in the "
"home directory of the user. See <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>k5login</"
"refentrytitle><manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry> for more details. "
"Please note that an empty .k5login file will deny all access to this user. "
"To activate this feature, use 'access_provider = krb5' in your SSSD "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Šī aizmugursistēma nodrošina arī piekļuves vadību, kas balstīta uz failu "
".k5login lietotāja mājas direktorijā. Sīkāk skatiet <citerefentry> "
"<refentrytitle>k5login</refentrytitle><manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </"
"citerefentry>. Lūdzu, ņemiet vērā, ka tukšs fails .k5login šim lietotājam "
"liegs jebkādu piekļuvi. Lai aktivizētu šo līdzekli, SSSD konfigurācijā "
"izmantojiet „access_provider = krb5”."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:55
msgid ""
"In the case where the UPN is not available in the identity backend, "
"<command>sssd</command> will construct a UPN using the format "
"<replaceable>username</replaceable>@<replaceable>krb5_realm</replaceable>."
msgstr ""
"Gadījumā, ja identitātes aizmugursistēmā UPN nav pieejams, <command>sssd</"
"command> izveidos UPN formātā <replaceable>username</replaceable>"
"@<replaceable>krb5_realm</replaceable>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:77
msgid ""
"Specifies the comma-separated list of IP addresses or hostnames of the "
"Kerberos servers to which SSSD should connect, in the order of preference. "
"For more information on failover and server redundancy, see the "
"<quote>FAILOVER</quote> section. An optional port number (preceded by a "
"colon) may be appended to the addresses or hostnames.  If empty, service "
"discovery is enabled; for more information, refer to the <quote>SERVICE "
"DISCOVERY</quote> section."
msgstr ""
"Norāda ar komatiem atdalītu to Kerberos serveru IP adrešu vai resursdatoru "
"nosaukumu sarakstu, ar kuriem SSSD jāsavienojas, vēlamības secībā. Plašāku "
"informāciju par pārņemšanu un serveru dublēšanu skatiet sadaļā <quote>"
"FAILOVER</quote>. Adresēm vai resursdatoru nosaukumiem var pievienot "
"neobligātu porta numuru (pirms tā kols).  Ja tukšs, ir iespējota pakalpojumu "
"atklāšana; plašāku informāciju skatiet sadaļā <quote>SERVICE DISCOVERY</"
"quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:106
msgid ""
"The name of the Kerberos realm. This option is required and must be "
"specified."
msgstr "Kerberos apgabala nosaukums. Šī opcija ir obligāta un jānorāda."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:113
msgid "krb5_kpasswd, krb5_backup_kpasswd (string)"
msgstr "krb5_kpasswd, krb5_backup_kpasswd (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:116
msgid ""
"If the change password service is not running on the KDC, alternative "
"servers can be defined here. An optional port number (preceded by a colon) "
"may be appended to the addresses or hostnames."
msgstr ""
"Ja KDC paroles maiņas pakalpojums nedarbojas, šeit var definēt alternatīvus "
"serverus. Adresēm vai resursdatoru nosaukumiem var pievienot neobligātu "
"porta numuru (pirms tā kols)."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:122
msgid ""
"For more information on failover and server redundancy, see the "
"<quote>FAILOVER</quote> section.  NOTE: Even if there are no more kpasswd "
"servers to try, the backend is not switched to operate offline if "
"authentication against the KDC is still possible."
msgstr ""
"Plašāku informāciju par pārņemšanu un serveru dublēšanu skatiet sadaļā "
"<quote>FAILOVER</quote>.  PIEZĪME: pat ja vairs nav kpasswd serveru, ko "
"mēģināt, aizmugursistēma netiek pārslēgta bezsaistes darbībā, ja "
"autentifikācija pret KDC joprojām ir iespējama."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:129
msgid "Default: Use the KDC"
msgstr "Noklusējums: Use the KDC"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:135
msgid "krb5_ccachedir (string)"
msgstr "krb5_ccachedir (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:138
msgid ""
"Directory to store credential caches. All the substitution sequences of "
"krb5_ccname_template can be used here, too, except %d and %P. This option is "
"only consulted when krb5_ccname_template refers to it with %d; otherwise it "
"is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Direktorija akreditācijas datu kešatmiņu glabāšanai. Šeit var izmantot arī "
"visas krb5_ccname_template aizstāšanas secības, izņemot %d un %P. Šī opcija "
"tiek ņemta vērā tikai tad, ja krb5_ccname_template uz to atsaucas ar %d; "
"citādi tā tiek ignorēta."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:145
msgid ""
"SSSD does not create this directory. It must already exist and the user "
"logging in must have 'rwx' access to it, which matches the behaviour of "
"<citerefentry> <refentrytitle>kinit</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>1</manvolnum> "
"</citerefentry>.  Authentication fails if the directory is missing."
msgstr ""
"SSSD šo direktoriju neveido. Tai jau jāeksistē, un lietotājam, kas piesakās, "
"tai jābūt „rwx” piekļuvei, kas atbilst <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>kinit</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>1</manvolnum> </citerefentry> rīcībai.  Ja "
"direktorijas nav, autentifikācija neizdodas."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:155
msgid "Default: /tmp"
msgstr "Noklusējums: /tmp"

