#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:3
msgid "krb5_auth_timeout (integer)"
msgstr "krb5_auth_timeout (vesels skaitlis)"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:6
msgid ""
"Timeout in seconds after an online authentication request or change password "
"request is aborted. If possible, the authentication request is continued "
"offline."
msgstr ""
"Noildze sekundēs, pēc kuras tiešsaistes autentifikācijas pieprasījums vai "
"paroles maiņas pieprasījums tiek pārtraukts. Ja iespējams, autentifikācijas "
"pieprasījums tiek turpināts bezsaistē."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:17
msgid "krb5_validate (boolean)"
msgstr "krb5_validate (Būla vērtība)"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:20
msgid ""
"Verify with the help of krb5_keytab that the TGT obtained has not been "
"spoofed. The keytab is checked for entries sequentially, and the first entry "
"with a matching realm is used for validation. If no entry matches the realm, "
"the last entry in the keytab is used. This process can be used to validate "
"environments using cross-realm trust by placing the appropriate keytab entry "
"as the last entry or the only entry in the keytab file."
msgstr ""
"Ar krb5_keytab palīdzību pārbaudīt, ka iegūtā TGT nav viltota. Keytab "
"ieraksti tiek pārbaudīti secīgi, un validēšanai tiek izmantots pirmais "
"ieraksts ar atbilstošu apgabalu. Ja neviens ieraksts neatbilst apgabalam, "
"tiek izmantots pēdējais keytab ieraksts. Šo procesu var izmantot, lai "
"validētu vides, kurās izmanto starpapgabalu uzticēšanos, ievietojot "
"atbilstošo keytab ierakstu kā pēdējo vai vienīgo ierakstu keytab failā."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:29
msgid ""
"Entries where the principal name ends with a '$', i.e. AD's host accounts, "
"are filtered because often AD does not issue service tickets for those "
"principals. Only if is is the only entry it is tried."
msgstr ""
"Ieraksti, kuru principāla nosaukums beidzas ar „$”, t. i., AD resursdatoru "
"konti, tiek izfiltrēti, jo AD bieži neizdod pakalpojuma biļetes šiem "
"principāliem. Tas tiek mēģināts tikai tad, ja tas ir vienīgais ieraksts."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:35
msgid "Default: false (IPA and AD provider: true)"
msgstr "Noklusējums: false (IPA un AD nodrošinātājam: true)"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:38
msgid ""
"Please note that the ticket validation is the first step when checking the "
"PAC (see 'pac_check' in the <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd.conf</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry> manual page for "
"details). If ticket validation is disabled the PAC checks will be skipped as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"Lūdzu, ņemiet vērā, ka biļetes validēšana ir pirmais solis, pārbaudot PAC "
"(sīkāk skatiet „pac_check” rokasgrāmatas lapā <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>"
"sssd.conf</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry>). Ja "
"biļešu validēšana ir atspējota, tiks izlaistas arī PAC pārbaudes."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:50
msgid "krb5_renewable_lifetime (string)"
msgstr "krb5_renewable_lifetime (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:53
msgid ""
"Request a renewable ticket with a total lifetime, given as an integer "
"immediately followed by a time unit:"
msgstr ""
"Pieprasīt atjaunojamu biļeti ar kopējo dzīves ilgumu, kas norādīts kā vesels "
"skaitlis, kam tieši seko laika vienība:"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:58 include/krb5_options.xml:92
#: include/krb5_options.xml:129
msgid "<emphasis>s</emphasis> for seconds"
msgstr "<emphasis>s</emphasis> — sekundes"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:61 include/krb5_options.xml:95
#: include/krb5_options.xml:132
msgid "<emphasis>m</emphasis> for minutes"
msgstr "<emphasis>m</emphasis> — minūtes"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:64 include/krb5_options.xml:98
#: include/krb5_options.xml:135
msgid "<emphasis>h</emphasis> for hours"
msgstr "<emphasis>h</emphasis> — stundas"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:67 include/krb5_options.xml:101
#: include/krb5_options.xml:138
msgid "<emphasis>d</emphasis> for days."
msgstr "<emphasis>d</emphasis> — dienas."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:70 include/krb5_options.xml:141
msgid "If there is no unit given, <emphasis>s</emphasis> is assumed."
msgstr "Ja vienība nav norādīta, tiek pieņemts <emphasis>s</emphasis>."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:74 include/krb5_options.xml:145
msgid ""
"NOTE: It is not possible to mix units.  To set the renewable lifetime to one "
"and a half hours, use '90m' instead of '1h30m'."
msgstr ""
"PIEZĪME: Vienības jaukt nav iespējams.  Lai atjaunojamo dzīves ilgumu "
"iestatītu uz pusotru stundu, „1h30m” vietā izmantojiet „90m”."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:79
msgid "Default: not set, i.e. the TGT is not renewable"
msgstr "Noklusējums: nav iestatīts, t. i., TGT nav atjaunojama"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:85
msgid "krb5_lifetime (string)"
msgstr "krb5_lifetime (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:88
msgid ""
"Request ticket with a lifetime, given as an integer immediately followed by "
"a time unit:"
msgstr ""
"Pieprasīt biļeti ar dzīves ilgumu, kas norādīts kā vesels skaitlis, kam "
"tieši seko laika vienība:"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:104
msgid "If there is no unit given <emphasis>s</emphasis> is assumed."
msgstr "Ja vienība nav norādīta, tiek pieņemts <emphasis>s</emphasis>."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:108
msgid ""
"NOTE: It is not possible to mix units.  To set the lifetime to one and a "
"half hours please use '90m' instead of '1h30m'."
msgstr ""
"PIEZĪME: Vienības jaukt nav iespējams.  Lai dzīves ilgumu iestatītu uz "
"pusotru stundu, lūdzu, „1h30m” vietā izmantojiet „90m”."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:113
msgid ""
"Default: not set, i.e. the default ticket lifetime configured on the KDC."
msgstr ""
"Noklusējums: nav iestatīts, t. i., KDC konfigurētais noklusējuma biļetes "
"dzīves ilgums."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:120
msgid "krb5_renew_interval (string)"
msgstr "krb5_renew_interval (virkne)"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:123
msgid ""
"The time in seconds between two checks if the TGT should be renewed. TGTs "
"are renewed if about half of their lifetime is exceeded, given as an integer "
"immediately followed by a time unit:"
msgstr ""
"Laiks sekundēs starp divām pārbaudēm, vai TGT jāatjauno. TGT tiek "
"atjaunotas, ja pārsniegta aptuveni puse to dzīves ilguma; norāda kā veselu "
"skaitli, kam tieši seko laika vienība:"

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:150
msgid "If this option is not set or is 0 the automatic renewal is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ja šī opcija nav iestatīta vai ir 0, automātiskā atjaunošana ir atspējota."

#. type: Content of: <variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: include/krb5_options.xml:163
msgid ""
"Specifies if the host and user principal should be canonicalized. This "
"feature is available with MIT Kerberos 1.7 and later versions."
msgstr ""
"Norāda, vai resursdatora un lietotāja principāls jākanonizē. Šis līdzeklis "
"pieejams ar MIT Kerberos 1.7 un jaunākām versijām."

